      "message": "The reason variable is a pycadf object, right? We could elaborate on the docstring here to explicitly say what it is. This might help prevent people from doing something like: \n\n  reason \u003d \u0027Something broke!\u0027\n  _emit(reason\u003dreason)\n\nInstead of using the pycadf library to generate a Reason object.",
