      "writtenOn": "2016-12-19T20:41:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In the method signature for _emit() `actor_dict` already defaults to None. For the sake of simplicity, I would opt to not specify this at all and let the default in the method signature do it\u0027s thing. Otherwise there could be a slight chance of inconsistency if the default changes in one place but not the other. If for some reason the default in the _emit() method changes, then we\u0027ll have a reason to override it in this methods, if we need to.\n\nThis comment applies to the other methods in this module that call _emit().",
      "revId": "e68dd0a5d86aed977ed0c6a55613cd6697414bfb",
